        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rennae Stubbs, Renáta Tomanová, Pavel Vojtisek, Lisa Raymond\n- Events: 2003 Family Circle Cup – Doubles\n- Topics: tennis, marriage, citizenship\n\nFacts:\n- Renáta Tomanová was born on 9 December 1954 and is a former professional tennis player from Czechoslovakia.\n- Rennae Stubbs was born on 26 March 1971 and is an Australian retired tennis player.\n- In the 2003 Family Circle Cup – Doubles, Lisa Raymond and Rennae Stubbs were the defending champions, but Lisa Raymond did not compete in that edition.\n- Pavel Vojtisek obtained West German citizenship in his early 20s.\n- Pavel Vojtisek is married to Renáta Tomanová, who was a two-time Grand Slam finalist.",
